# Deploy and commit after every change

When a code or config change is complete (feature, fix, or UI), deploy to production and commit in the same turn. Do not wait for the user to say deploy or commit.

1. Run `npx tsc --noEmit --pretty false`.
2. If it passes: `npx vercel@59.10.0 deploy --prod --yes --scope juanmolinaa2005-6036s-projects` from the repo root.
3. If the build fails, fix TypeScript/build errors and deploy again.
4. Commit the change with `git add -A && git commit -m "<mensaje en español que describa el cambio>"`. Do not push unless the user asks.
5. Reply with https://vantko.com when production is ready.

Do not generate paid OpenAI/fal/Kling jobs from Cursor as part of deploy.
